1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,030
Man: I just got an email saying that the company picnic at Emerald Park has been rescheduled.

2
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:08,109
Woman: Oh, really? How come?

3
00:00:08,109 --> 00:00:13,000
Man: Apparently the forecast is terrible next Wednesday... heavy rain.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,050
Woman: Oh, that makes sense. Did they mention the new date?

5
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:20,210
Man: Yes, this Saturday, the tenth.

6
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,880
Woman: I'll mark my calendar

7
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:27,100
I'm looking forward to having some food in good company.
